Carolyn: Okay.
Doctor: Let's first look at your vital signs. Hey, dragon, show me the vital signs. Great, so everything looks good from that perspective. Um, so looking at you, I don't appreciate any cervical lymphadenopathy. Your heart is a nice regular rate and rhythm, and your lungs sound really clear. On your right elbow, you do have some edema and inflammation of your right olecranon and there's some tenderness and an effusion right there. So um, does that hurt when I press it?
